name: DEV-MAS-ENGINEER
version: 1.0.0
constitution: sub_mas-master-constitution.yaml
title: 🦆 DEV-MAS-ENGINEER — Multi-Agent System Developer (delegator)
description: 'v1.0.0 | Fully autonomous. Thin delegator that routes to sub_mas-dev-director.

  Demo recipes (runnable end-to-end): - docs/DEMO-RESEARCH-TEAM.md — 5-agent research
  team (intro demo) - docs/DEMO-MULTI-ARCH-30.md — 30-agent multi-arch team (stress-test
  demo). Drive it via the bundled recipe: recipe/dev-mas-engineer-30agents.yaml'
instructions: '## STEP 0 — MODE-CHECK

  Verify working directory is within mas-engineer project scope.

  If not in mas-engineer context, abort with clear message.


  ## STEP 1 — DELEGATE TO DIRECTOR

  Delegate all dev-mas-engineer tasks to sub_mas-dev-director.

  This recipe is a thin delegator only — it does not contain logic directly.

  Load sub_mas-dev-director and execute its instructions.


  ## STEP 2 — COLLECT RESULTS

  Collect results from sub_mas-dev-director and return to caller.

  '
